The CUDA kernels in that project were ported to FlyDSL for AMD CDNA
architectures. The structure of each optimization ladder, the selection of
kernels, and the sequence of optimizations within each ladder originate there.

Hardware facts about AMD CDNA 4 (gfx950) reproduced in flyopt/env.py are taken
from AMD's published "Introducing AMD CDNA 4 Architecture" whitepaper. All
performance measurements in this repository are unofficial and were neither
produced nor endorsed by Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.
